{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4736442f-7118-8de9-9be6-b29782ef21b6",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T12:12:01-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:08:01-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:08:06-04:00",
      "duration": 51,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, so I'm calling about the storm drain on the corner by my house, it's at 33 Mill Street up on the Hill, and it has been completely full to the top since the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, and it's not draining at all, the water just sits there brown and then it spills over onto the sidewalk and now the whole sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit, you can't walk without sliding, and I've got neighbors with strollers going out into the street to get around it, and honestly I feel like this drain is always the one that gets ignored, so I figured I'd call instead of just waiting for somebody to notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:08:57-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry, that sounds like a mess. Let me get this down. 33 Mill Street, and the drain is right at the corner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:08-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the corner right next to my place. Sorry, hold on, my phone has this pop-up window that keeps appearing and I can't close it, it's some ad or something, [pause] okay, ignore that. Anyway, yes, the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:25-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is the water still standing in it right now, or has it gone down at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:34-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's still full. It's like a bowl of sludge. There's leaves and grit packed in the grate, I can see it from my front step. It went down maybe an inch Sunday and that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:50-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it sounds clogged with debris rather than just slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:09:56-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And can I ask, is that a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me some of the streets around here are state and I don't want to be calling the wrong people and getting bounced around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:14-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Mill Street is a city street as far as I know, so a drain on the corner of it should be ours. If it turns out to be on a state road, we'd pass it along ourselves, you wouldn't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:34-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good, because honestly I'm kind of tired of being passed around. It's the same thing every time there's a big rain, it fills up and nothing happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:10:47-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check and clear that drain, and I'll note the mud and grit on the sidewalk so they see it's been overflowing. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:08-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:10-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194, that's right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:12-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:14-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:17-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moira Doyle. D-O-Y-L-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:19-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Moira. The crews are busy catching up from the weekend rain, so it may take a few days, but this one's standing full so I'll flag it as a priority. If it starts backing toward anyone's house, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:37-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just hope somebody actually comes this time. It's been three days of looking at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:45-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now, and you'll have a work order on it. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:54-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T12:11:57-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
